		{"id":"42d6aa963b1af407","x":1926,"y":-4120,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"dq rules"},
		{"id":"6f02a547b309cf7b","x":1916,"y":-4024,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"unified dq rules"},
		{"id":"7b7a39841c36c1a2","x":1435,"y":-4274,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Trigger via payload"},
		{"id":"06bcf170a54e53aa","x":2420,"y":-5120,"width":340,"height":240,"type":"text","text":"1. Client inference (Agent)\n2. Source inference (Agent)\n3. Table inference (Agent)\n4. PK & FK (Agent)\n5. PKRT & FKRT (Agent)\n6. Reinfer table (Agent)\n7. Reinfer source (Agent)\n8. Edges. (Python Script)"}
